==English==
[[File:Brass_thumbtack.jpg|thumb|A brass thumbtack]]

===Etymology===
{{compound|en|thumb|tack}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈθʌm.tæk/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|North America}} A small nail-like [[tack]] with a slightly [[rounded]] [[head]] that can be [[pressed]] into place with light [[pressure]] from the [[thumb]]; used for hanging light [[article]]s on a [[wall]] or [[noticeboard]].
#: {{syn|en|drawing pin|q1=British|pushpin}}
#* {{quote-song|en|date=2016-06-10|album=Who Am I|url=https://genius.com/Blocboy-jb-no-chorus-pt-5-lyrics|title=No Chorus, Pt. 5 |note=1:20–1:27|author={{w|BlocBoy JB}}|passage=You say that I'm broke my nigga, how is that?<br/>Bitch I'm stickin to this paper like a '''thumbtack'''}}

